- Charge intra-Ark Lightning fees on payments between our own wallets
  With `[fees.intra_ark]` set, a Lightning payment of an invoice that the
  server issued for one of its own wallets pays the intra-Ark send fee, and
  its receiver the intra-Ark receive fee. Payments to and from the outside
  still pay `lightning_send` and `lightning_receive`.
